      "start_seconds": 379.99,
      "end_seconds": 414.23,
      "duration_seconds": 34.24,
      "text": "I'll request a blood count, it'll help with rectal bleeding. I'd like you to take lactulose, 15 ml, twice a day, four weeks. You take it by mouth. That should help with constipation. The treatment will be a haemorrhoid cream, 1 application, twice a day, one week. That should help with haemorrhoids. Eat more fibre and drink water. Book a review in four weeks. That's all from me. Any questions?"
